<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_93df58fe-c98a-4ec1-aa2b-6388224b5435"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c3eae73e-57a5-4ba6-a8f3-047d2c830660"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_887fffef-e513-4adb-b940-82ef2ba9af5a"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-def.appropriated"><b><i>appropriated</i></b></defterm> means
appropriated from the Consolidated Fund.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_816cf254-e666-41ad-9130-93fa8259c9c1"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-def.appropriationyear"><b><i>appropriation
year</i></b></defterm> means the year from 1 July 2025 to 30 June
2026.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_e3a63d33-a7a8-48b8-978a-e4f0ad206c3e"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-def.services"><b><i>services</i></b></defterm> includes the
following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ce2350df-dd20-40ab-b471-027fdbb36abb" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">capital works and services,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7ad79f48-cfd3-48b1-8e93-01f3d6d934d7" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">recurrent services,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_68a9ec7f-1012-4f7a-9d3d-041acd151c77" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">repayment of debt.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1293cf43-7d63-4690-8701-f9884f6fe415"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A reference in the <legref refid="act-2018-055"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government
Sector Finance Act 2018</i></name></legref> to an annual Appropriation Act
includes a reference to this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


