<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_0d51053c-5763-4bcb-b666-3bf551417625"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Appropriation for Legislature</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5c8113b6-d59d-4fd4-a8b3-2b55e95599e5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_fdf79336-15c2-438b-bed6-114ab073d52d"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Appropriation for services of
Legislature</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The sum of $250,611,831 is appropriated to the
Legislature for the services of the Legislature for the appropriation
year.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_7ec32f62-e10d-4563-8ad2-66b75180fbd6"
id="sec.4-note"><heading guid="_879d914b-3d8f-4208-a1da-a9943830bc78"
id="sec.4-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The appropriation, together with funds from other
sources, is intended to fund&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c461c175-2ac4-48fd-a034-5a51f3e588bf" id="sec.4-note-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">expenses to the sum of $266,288,965,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_53d4e5de-c4ee-437b-9f77-ad41a79bf7ff" id="sec.4-note-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">capital expenditure to the sum of
$27,362,000.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></note>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4e6ccece-ee5e-4bec-a0ed-569aa694e62a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_0b34b92b-435e-4f46-b5e1-ab5ecae9c8b8"
id="pt.3-he"><b>General</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dc9ff9aa-3daa-4d81-b5d6-6ddea7547e88"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_6131359c-2111-4f00-a62b-6373081b4775"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Payments authorised on lapse of
appropriation</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An amount is taken to have been expended out of a
sum appropriated for a purpose by this Act if the amount was
paid&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_384a0ddc-5429-4d10-a56e-d439b31faafb" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">for the purpose under the <legref
refid="act-2018-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act 2018</i></name></legref>,
section 4.10, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4b68666c-3219-4bd2-8686-90fb884adef8" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">during the appropriation year and before the date
of assent to this Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</level>
</content>


